 een publiek te vinden. Hun weg voert van kleine optredens naar grotere podia, terwijl vriendschap, persoonlijke geschiedenis en ambities de groep beïnvloeden. David Mitchell volgt hun korte bestaan in een periode van maatschappelijke en culturele verandering. Het verhaal onderzoekt wat gezamenlijk muziek maken mogelijk maakt en welke druk groeiende bekendheid op mensen kan leggen.","work_id":987135009,"evidence":[{"note":"UtopiaAvenue9789029092968 Dutchhardcover, DavidStephenMitchell/sourceDavidMitchell, KBorigineelSceptre2020. Fictieveband1967–68nietbestaandemuziekbiografie of1984publicatie.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p425880192"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-036.json#87","checked_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.960Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-review-008.json","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p425880192","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL20748683W"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Bounded official bulk-source attempt for this exact edition did not yield an identity-approved asset. Preserve existing resolver and document its actual image or neutral placeholder in hosted acceptance; not proof of provider-wide absence.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789029092968","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_source_failure_no_retry","coverId":12983426,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"0e5eaf5635f1c02234e225a0e3a9e680fc357d0b4dee55ac8eb2522a8c89ba78"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.965Z","editionKey":"/books/OL40229463M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder; not proof that no cover exists at the provider or elsewhere."}],"language":"nl","provenance":"original_source_reviewed_summary","source_url":"htt