st de woede in zichzelf en hoopt in de grote stad aan zijn oude bestaan te ontsnappen. Maar ook daar ontmoet hij een wereld die door verlangens, macht en onrust wordt beheerst. Salman Rushdie verbindt zijn persoonlijke vlucht met een satirische blik op een welvarende samenleving waarin verdwijnen moeilijker blijkt dan opnieuw beginnen.","work_id":987135017,"evidence":[{"note":"Woede9789074336635 is Fury2001SalmanRushdie, CPNBBoekenweekuitgave. TweeOLeditionrecordszijn exactzelfdeISBN, één gekozen, geendubbeleeditie ofnieuwWorkdaarom. Regulierepaperbacknietde200genummerdehardcovers.","type":"reviewed_identity_and_bibliography","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p212382683"],"reference":"new-work-dossier-readings-036.json#105","checked_at":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.960Z"},{"type":"original_substantive_source_review","review":"content-amendment-004.json","sources":["https://data.bibliotheken.nl/id/nbt/p212382683","https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/158929/fury-by-salman-rushdie/","https://www.penguinrandomhouse.com/books/158929/fury-by-salman-rushdie/readers-guide","https://openlibrary.org/works/OL457174W"]},{"type":"explicit_contributor_roles","credits":[],"limitation":"Existing schema has one primary Work author; no synthetic combined-author identity or author merge."},{"note":"Bounded official bulk-source attempt for this exact edition did not yield an identity-approved asset. Preserve existing resolver and document its actual image or neutral placeholder in hosted acceptance; not proof of provider-wide absence.","type":"no_verified_cover_asset_retained","isbn13":"9789074336635","status":"no_verified_asset_retained","attempts":[{"status":"bulk_archive_unavailable","coverId":7255584,"receipt":"cover-archive-v2-readback.json","receiptSha256":"0e5eaf5635f1c02234e225a0e3a9e680fc357d0b4dee55ac8eb2522a8c89ba78"}],"checkedAt":"2026-11-03T07:32:53.966Z","editionKey":"/books/OL25425879M","limitation":"No verified image is imported. Existing neutral placeholder;